                <pb facs="0194" n="86" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg86"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-27"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27, 1893</hi></date>.
                        (Received December 28.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have been in Rio most of the time; always when needed. Your suggestion will be
                    observed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thompson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
